Being polymorphed into a human has random effects on ability scores and
level.  To the best of my knowledge, the name you pick has nothing to do
with it.  Strength does seem to have trends; normally, it will go up fairly
consistently (or at least high, so if you already have a high strength, it
might go down), unless you get cursed somehow.  I don't know what causes it,
but sometimes strength will decide to keep going down instead (this info
gained with the help of your friendly neighborhood polymorph ring).  This is
exceedingly bad, especially if your polymorph ring happens to be cursed.


